# Per-Dockerfile ignore for docker/runtime/Dockerfile.docker.
# BuildKit >=1.5 picks this up automatically when -f points at that Dockerfile.
#
# This image is a thin derivative of procway-code-runtime (everything else is
# already baked into the base), so the ONLY file it needs from the repo is the
# docker wrapper. Excluding everything else keeps the build context at a few KB
# instead of the tens of MB the base image's context costs.
*
!docker/runtime/docker-wrapper.sh
